    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="structllvm_1_1_rope_ref_count_string" kindref="compound">RopeRefCountString</ref> - This struct is allocated with &apos;new char[]&apos; from the heap, and represents a reference counted chunk of string data. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>When its ref count drops to zero, it is delete[]&apos;d. This is primarily managed through the <ref refid="structllvm_1_1_rope_piece" kindref="compound">RopePiece</ref> class below. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
